{"id":1838,"bangumiId":1838,"type":2,"name":"しにがみのバラッド。","name_cn":"死神的歌谣","date":"2006-03-02","year":"2006","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/d7/65/1838_0F86Z.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/d7/65/1838_0F86Z.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/d7/65/1838_0F86Z.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/d7/65/1838_0F86Z.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/d7/65/1838_0F86Z.jpg"},"summary":"动画讲述一个普通的少女在遇到一只黑猫后突然晕倒，醒来后发现自己变成了全身雪白，手持镰刀的死神的故事…… \r\n　　主人公少女·小桃是一个死神，手中巨大的散发著淡淡光芒的镰刀，证明了她掌管死亡之人的身份。她的使命是取走人类的生命，总是与使魔·丹尼尔这个长著翅膀的黑猫一起出现，夺取人类的魂魄。不过由於她雪白的不同於其他死神的容貌，同伴们都把她叫做“怪人”。不仅如此，她生性爱管闲事善良却又爱哭，完全没有个死神的样子。本作每话一个故事，描写的就是小桃与各种各样的人类发生的，充满淡淡悲伤的故事。","rating":{"rank":4595,"total":641,"count":{"1":0,"2":2,"3":9,"4":12,"5":69,"6":188,"7":238,"8":104,"9":13,"10":6},"score":6.6},"collection":{"on_hold":106,"dropped":48,"wish":568,"collect":1009,"doing":60},"tags":[{"name":"治愈","count":176,"total_count":309543},{"name":"TV","count":126,"total_count":1450845},{"name":"轻小说","count":121,"total_count":11467},{"name":"少女死神","count":102,"total_count":102},{"name":"2006","count":100,"total_count":34928},{"name":"轻小说改","count":79,"total_count":511270},{"name":"死神的歌谣","count":67,"total_count":67},{"name":"望月智充","count":64,"total_count":3457},{"name":"GroupTac","count":37,"total_count":505},{"name":"治愈系","count":36,"total_count":25461},{"name":"2006年3月","count":26,"total_count":89},{"name":"奇幻","count":20,"total_count":494889},{"name":"吉田玲子","count":19,"total_count":7417},{"name":"小说改","count":17,"total_count":168781},{"name":"轻改","count":15,"total_count":156352},{"name":"2006年","count":12,"total_count":1912},{"name":"日本","count":11,"total_count":316696},{"name":"补番","count":9,"total_count":10587},{"name":"OVA","count":6,"total_count":373272},{"name":"グループ・タック","count":4,"total_count":147},{"name":"TVA","count":3,"total_count":16364},{"name":"单元剧","count":3,"total_count":2168},{"name":"神小说","